---
import { SERVICES } from '../lib/services';
---

<section
	id="galerie"
	class="relative min-h-[70vh] overflow-hidden bg-[#00004B] px-6 pb-16 pt-36 text-white md:pb-24 md:pt-44"
	lang="fr"
	aria-labelledby="gallery-heading"
>
	<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
		<div class="absolute -right-20 top-20 h-80 w-80 rounded-full opacity-20 blur-[100px]" style="background: #F5B544;"></div>
		<div class="absolute -left-20 bottom-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full opacity-10 blur-[100px]" style="background: #F5B544;"></div>
	</div>

	<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl">
		<header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl md:mb-16">
			<p class="mb-4 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary md:text-xs">Galerie</p>
			<h1 id="gallery-heading" class="font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.75rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight">
				Aperçu de nos <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary via-primary-light to-primary bg-clip-text text-transparent">gammes</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/70 md:text-lg">
				Découvrez les principales catégories de vêtements que nous proposons. Les modèles, tissus et finitions se définissent selon le cahier des charges de chaque commande.
			</p>
		</header>

		<div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4">
			{SERVICES.map((service) => (
				<article class="group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04]">
					<a href={`/services/${service.slug}`} class="block overflow-hidden" aria-label={`Découvrir : ${service.title}`}>
						<div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-white/5">
							<img
								src={service.image}
								alt={service.title}
								class="gallery-card-image h-full w-full object-cover"
								width="640"
								height="480"
								loading="lazy"
								decoding="async"
							/>
						</div>
					</a>
					<div class="p-5 md:p-6">
						<h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug md:text-xl">
							<a href={`/services/${service.slug}`} class="hover:text-primary focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-primary">
								{service.title}
							</a>
						</h2>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/70">{service.description}</p>
						<a href={`/services/${service.slug}`} class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-primary hover:text-primary-light">
							Découvrir le service <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</article>
			))}
		</div>

		<p class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/70">
			Les visuels donnent un aperçu des catégories proposées. Pour confirmer un modèle, un tissu ou une finition, contactez notre équipe avant de passer commande.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 text-center sm:flex-row sm:text-left">
			<p class="text-sm text-foreground/70">Vous avez un projet de confection ? Décrivez-nous vos besoins.</p>
			<a href="/contact" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-background hover:bg-primary-light focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">
				Demander un devis
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
		.gallery-card-image {
			transition: transform 220ms ease;
		}

		.group:hover .gallery-card-image {
			transform: scale(1.025);
		}
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.gallery-card-image {
			transition: none;
		}
	}
</style>
